# The site needs no environment variables.
#
# The only server code is api/geo.ts, a Vercel Edge Function that reads a
# country code off a request header Vercel sets for it. It takes no
# configuration. The client bundle reads no environment variables either, so
# nothing defined here would reach the browser.
#
# The RESEND_API_KEY, RESEND_FROM and TEAM_INBOX vars that used to live here
# belonged to api/send-contact.ts, which was deleted: nothing on the site had
# called it since the contact form was replaced by the booking card. If those
# names are still set in the Vercel project, remove them there, and revoke the
# Resend key itself in the Resend dashboard rather than only unsetting it.
